 x^2 + bx + a = 0 então  o  valor  de  |z| é  igual  a', '[{"key": "A", "text": "|z| = 1/√3."}, {"key": "B", "text": "|z| = 1/√5."}, {"key": "C", "text": "|z| = √3."}, {"key": "D", "text": "|z| = √5."}]'::jsonb, 'B', '', 'https://www.comvest.unicamp.br/vestibulares-anteriores/provas-e-gabaritos/', 2018, 'official', true, '{"bluex_id": "UNICAMP_2018_29", "assuntos_originais": ["mathematics"]}'::jsonb, '2026-10-16 19:55:21.272835+00', '2026-10-16 19:55:21.179+00'
